[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:For Sale]
[00:00.76]Lesson 89 | 第89课
[00:02.80]For sale | 待售
[00:04.92]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:10.70]Why couldn't Nigel decide? | 为什么奈杰尔不能决定？
[00:15.27]Good afternoon. | 下午好。
[00:17.90]I believe that this house is for sale. | 我想这栋房子是待售的。
[00:22.64]That's right. | 没错。
[00:24.22]May I have a look at it, please? | 我能进去看看吗？
[00:27.65]Yes, of course. | 当然可以。
[00:29.72]Come in. | 请进。
[00:31.06]How long have you lived here? | 你在这里住了多久了？
[00:34.76]I've lived here for twenty years. | 我在这里住了二十年了。
[00:38.06]Twenty years! | 二十年了！
[00:40.16]That's a long time. | 那可真久啊。
[00:42.54]Yes, I've been here since 1976. | 是的，我从1976年就住在这里了。
[00:47.60]Then why do you want to sell it? | 那你为什么要卖掉它呢？
[00:51.60]Because I've just retired. | 因为我刚退休。
[00:54.30]I want to buy a small house in the country. | 我想在乡下买一栋小房子。
[00:59.46]How much does this house cost? | 这栋房子多少钱？
[01:03.38]￡68, 500. | 68,500英镑。
[01:08.16]That's a lot of money! | 那可真是一大笔钱！
[01:10.61]It's worth every penny of it. | 它值这个价。
[01:13.66]Well, I like the house, but I can't decide yet. | 嗯，我喜欢这栋房子，但我还不能决定。
[01:20.00]My wife must see it first. | 我妻子必须先看看。
[01:23.51]Women always have the last word. | 女人总是说了算。